# =============================================================================
# Leon: what is NOT versioned.
# Everything ignored here can be rebuilt from the scripts (datasets, tokenized
# corpora, tokenizer, checkpoints) or reinstalled (environments, dependencies).
# =============================================================================

# --- Datasets, tokenized corpora, tokenizer and trained models ---------------
# data/ holds raw downloads (Wikipedia parquet), JSONL, .bin token files and the
# trained tokenizer: GBs, regenerated by phase0_bigram/prepare.py and phase2_tokenizer/*.
/data/
# checkpoints/ holds model weights + optimizer state (hundreds of MB each).
/checkpoints/
# Model weights anywhere else in the tree, in any common format.
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
*.safetensors
*.onnx
*.gguf
# Large data formats that should never be committed by accident.
*.parquet
*.arrow
*.npy
*.npz
*.memmap

# --- Experiment tracking and logs --------------------------------------------
logs/
runs/
wandb/
mlruns/
lightning_logs/
*.log

# --- Python --------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.so
.venv/
venv/
env/
.python-version
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/
.eggs/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# --- Jupyter -------------------------------------------------------------------
# Walkthrough notebooks ARE versioned (with outputs, so they can be read on GitHub).
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# --- Web app (apps/web) ----------------------------------------------------------
node_modules/
apps/web/dist/
.vite/
npm-debug.log*

# --- Secrets and local configuration ------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# --- Editors and operating systems --------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
